\ A freestanding build whose image carries method dispatch entries must be
\ rejected at build time: the freestanding runtime has no dispatch-replay
\ entrypoint, so the registrations would be silently dropped.

box: virtual{ fixnum } ;

bump: generic ( s -- n ) [ drop -1 ] ;
bump: method{ box } [ unmake-box 1 + ] ;

5 make-box bump drop
